{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065161/block/singleImage/3274962/df/01M833CAD8FHSVZKM7BHD16H0A.png?updatedAt=1795400573\"/><figcaption>深水埗警區特別職務隊第三隊人員聯同入境處展開掃黃行動，突擊搜查區內多個地點，共拘捕14名內地女子。(警方圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>深水埗警區特別職務隊第三隊人員聯同入境處周日（22日）在區內展開代號「闖岸」（DISTANTSHORE）的掃黃行動，突擊搜查區內多個地點，共拘捕14名女子。 行動中，人員共拘捕14名內地女子，年齡介乎28至61歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:49:26.687245+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T02:22:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T13:08:08.323099+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T03:42:41.161688+00:00","content_hash":"85eee5da8e9b2bb2e478af853c01c00e48ae054db28d59f2a0d4de01663a008f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:49:26.687245+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}